  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_15
    value: "<size=16>3 or more Scatters triggers \nFree Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=16>- Santa Claus symbol is also Wild.\n- Santa Claus appears in
