  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_4
    value: "<size=16>Wild substitutes for all symbols \nexcept Scatter."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXPANDING SANTA WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXTRA GIFT WILDS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <style=title><size=42>MULTIPLIER WILDS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES BONUS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=22>- Santa Claus symbol expands and fills the entire reel when it
      lands.

      - Santa Wild appears on reels 2 and 4 only.

      - In Free Games, it appears on all 5 reels.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<size=22>- During reel spin, Santa Claus may appear and throw Gift symbols
      onto the reel set.

      - Gift symbols become Wild where they land on the reels.

      - Any Scatters that land behind the Extra Gift Wilds count towards Free Games
      trigger.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: "<size=22>- If Santa Wild appears where there are already Gift Wilds, multipliers
      get added \n  to the reel.\n- x2 is awarded if there was one Gift Wild, and
      x3 is awarded if there were \n  two Gift Wilds on the reel.\n- When there are
      multiple multipliers in the reel, they are added to be multiplied \n  to total
      pay."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<size=22>- 3 or more Scatters in any position triggers Free Games.

      - During Free Games, Expanding Santa Wilds can appear in any reel.

      - During Free Games, 3 or more Scatters triggers additional spins.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>30 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Xmas Magic
